      description: "The Bank Logos API provides high-resolution logos for thousands of banks worldwide with a single API call, perfect for financial apps and fintech solutions. It enables users to transform confusing bank names and transaction codes into clear, recognizable visual identifiers."
      servers: [
        {
          description: "Production server"
          url: "https://api.bankconv.com"
